Date: Mon, 26 Oct 2026 00:00:00 +0900
Subject: [PATCH 19/19] fix(serializer/hwp): set the text-box storage bit on edited
 text boxes

A text box created through the edit API (createShapeControl with
shapeType "textbox", which the studio's text-box drawing also uses) kept
the SHAPE_COMPONENT storage word at 0x0008_0000 without the text-box bit
0x0100_0000. Hancom Hangul 2024 rejects such an HWP as damaged; the same
document saved as HWPX opens. hwpx_to_hwp already sets the bit only when a
text box is present (setting it on a plain shape is rejected too). Keep the
bit in sync with text_box when a text box is created, attached or detached.

Backport of upstream edwardkim/rhwp#8176 (fixes #8172, merged into devel
through #8228) onto v0.8.7.
